<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - ARGENTINA'S COMERCIAL H1 NET $19.82 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ARGENTINA'S COMERCIAL H1 NET $19.82 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1997. Net $19.82 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Oil, gas and utilities conglomerate Sociedad Comercial del Plata SA provided neither comparative, EPS nor ADR information. It did not detail second quarter results.</p>
<p>It reported a net worth of $454.4 million.</p>
<p>In the year to December 31, 1996, it had reported a net profit of $36.3 million and a net worth of $366 million.</p>
<p>((Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
